OL,3,ANepal intensifying efforts to free
OL,4,Ahundreds believed trapped in hydropower
OL,5,Atunnels
OL,6,
OL,7,FNepal says it is intensifying efforts
OL,8,Fto free hundreds of people trapped
OL,9,Finside tunnels at hydropower projects,
OL,10,Fincluding the Trishuli-3A site,
OL,11,Ffollowing Wednesday's flash floods
OL,13,FCrews - including experts from China
OL,14,Fand India - have been attempting to
OL,15,Fmake contact but have so far received
OL,16,Fno response from inside the tunnel,
OL,17,Fofficials say
OL,19,FHundreds of the people reported missing
OL,20,Fare believed to be employees of Nepal's
OL,21,Fhydropower sites
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
